e external delta bases come from another open change's parent'","AC says only 'an ordinary git push ... of a review change is accepted' — no step forces the stale-ref / external-base thin-pack condition that previously failed"],"finding":"The live acceptance test ('an ordinary git push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main (no packing flags) of a review change is accepted') may not reproduce the specific triggering condition the fix targets — a stale gerrit/main that causes git to build a thin pack whose external delta base comes from another open change's parent. An ordinary push from an up-to-date clone does not build such a thin pack, so the test could pass green without ever exercising the newly-accepted path.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2d37a0c9f6ca8dab","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance Criteria, line 5 ('an ordinary git push ... is accepted, and the Gerrit error_log shows no new FullConnectivityChecker MissingObjectException')","norm_id":"n162d4541ce56d788","priority":1.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"In the live AC, prescribe a push that reproduces the thin-pack external-base case (stale local gerrit/main plus a delta base from another open change), and assert that push is accepted; optionally capture a before/after (confirm the same push is rejected with the key on true, accepted with it false).","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes"